ed rotation, he showed flashes of being the consistent and confident scorer the Warriors obviously believed he could be over his first couple of campaigns."}, "$type": "app.bsky.embed.external#view"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 0, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-11-06T05:30:04.173Z", "labels": []}, {"uri": "at://did:plc:3ydq3ufqsbrhdzxbgnhp3peq/app.bsky.feed.post/3mzmmdf444k2p", "cid": "bafyreibqeksikadtdj7d7iaclqxqrba7f6s5mocuurn23enh7vg5nmw6oy", "author": {"did": "did:plc:3ydq3ufqsbrhdzxbgnhp3peq", "handle": "statsboye.bsky.social", "displayName": "statsboye", "avatar": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/avatar/plain/did:plc:3ydq3ufqsbrhdzxbgnhp3peq/bafkreigffir2o5rywecdnk6jbx4m2bdgs5by2j6g5an62ypvknozrn7kly", "associated": {"chat": {"allowIncoming": "following"}, "activitySubscription": {"allowSubscriptions": "followers"}}, "labels": [], "createdAt": "2023-07-01T02:08:55.587Z"}, "record": {"$type": "app.bsky.feed.post", "createdAt": "2026-11-06T05:06:21.135Z", "langs": ["en"], "text": "Miami Heat 76\nGolden State Warriors 91\nEnd - 3rd\nGolden State outscoring Heat 33-15 in final 9:25 of 3rd"}, "bookmarkCount": 0, "replyCount": 1, "repostCount": 0, "likeCount": 0, "quoteCount": 0, "indexedAt": "2026-11-06T05:06:20.083Z", "labels": []}]}